--- hash -p a program for diff
stand-in standin: l r
rc=0
--- hash -t
PWD/standin
--- a function still wins
function diff
--- the hash again
stand-in standin: l r
--- hash -d: the tool again
1c1
< a
---
> b
rc=1
--- bash's own builtins ignore it
builtin echo
builtin printf
--- hash -r: the tool again
stand-in standin: 
a
b
